{"sha": "fae66566404381e3a47f10721d43d04954541c7f81c41dbd1d86fd7d761f5668", "body": ["\\chapter{复数}\\label{ch:g12:complex}", "", "方程 $x^2 = -1$ 没有实数解。将 $\\R$ 扩充，添加一个新数 $\\iu$，", "其平方为 $-1$，得到复数域 $\\C$，", "其中\\emph{每一个}多项式方程都有解 ---", "且其运算刻画了平面的几何：平移、旋转", "与伸缩分别对应为加法与乘法。", "", "\\section{代数形式}", "", "\\begin{definition}[复数]\\label{def:g12:complex:def}", "所有\\emph{复数}\\index{复数}组成的集合为", "\\[", "\\C = \\{a + \\iu b : a, b \\in \\R\\},", "\\]", "其中 $\\iu$ 为满足唯一规则 $\\iu^2 = -1$ 的符号；加法与乘法", "按 $\\iu$ 的实系数多项式的方法进行，并将 $\\iu^2$ 化为 $-1$。", "实数 $a$ 与 $b$ 分别称为 \\emph{实部}\\index{实部}", "$\\Rea(z)$ 与 \\emph{虚部}\\index{虚部} $\\Ima(z)$，它们是 $z = a + \\iu b$ 的；这一表达式", "称为 $z$ 的\\emph{代数形式}\\index{代数形式}，且唯一：", "$a + \\iu b = a' + \\iu b'$ 当且仅当 $a = a'$ 且 $b = b'$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$(2 + 3\\iu)(1 - \\iu) = 2 - 2\\iu + 3\\iu - 3\\iu^2 = 5 + \\iu$.", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{definition}[共轭复数]\\label{def:g12:complex:conjugate}", "$z = a + \\iu b$ 的\\emph{共轭复数}\\index{共轭复数}为", "$\\conj{z} = a - \\iu b$.", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[共轭运算的性质]\\label{prop:g12:complex:conjugate}", "对所有 $z, w \\in \\C$：", "\\[", "\\conj{z + w} = \\conj z + \\conj w, \\quad", "\\conj{zw} = \\conj z\\,\\conj w, \\quad", "\\conj{\\conj z} = z, \\quad", "z + \\conj z = 2\\Rea(z), \\quad", "z - \\conj z = 2\\iu\\,\\Ima(z),", "\\]", "且 $z\\conj z = a^2 + b^2 \\geq 0$，其中 $z = a + \\iu b$。此外，$z \\in \\R$", "当且仅当 $z = \\conj z$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "以上均可由代数形式直接计算得到；例如", "$z\\conj z = (a + \\iu b)(a - \\iu b) = a^2 - (\\iu b)^2 = a^2 + b^2$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[复数的除法]\\label{met:g12:complex:division}", "要将商写成代数形式，只需将分子与分母同乘以", "分母的共轭复数：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{2 + \\iu} = \\frac{2 - \\iu}{(2+\\iu)(2-\\iu)} = \\frac{2 - \\iu}{5}", "= \\frac25 - \\frac15\\iu .", "\\]", "因此每个非零复数都有倒数，从而 $\\C$ 是一个", "\\emph{域}。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{复平面、模与辐角}", "", "\\begin{definition}[对应复数、模]\\label{def:g12:complex:modulus}", "在标准正交坐标系的平面中，点 $M(a, b)$ 是", "$z = a + \\iu b$ 的\\emph{像}，且 $z$ 为 $M$ 的\\emph{对应复数}\\index{对应复数}。", "$z$ 的\\emph{模}\\index{模}是点 $M$ 到原点的距离：", "\\[", "\\abs{z} = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} = \\sqrt{z\\conj z}.", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.5]", "  \\draw[->] (-0.7,0) -- (2.9,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-1.9) -- (0,2.1) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (2,1.5) -- (2,0) node[below right] {$a$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (2,1.5) -- (0,1.5) node[left] {$b$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (2,-1.5) -- (2,0);", "  \\draw[-Stealth,omDef,thick] (0,0) -- (2,1.5)", "    node[midway, above left, font=\\small] {$\\abs z$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth,omThm,thick] (0,0) -- (2,-1.5);", "  \\fill (2,1.5) circle (1pt) node[above right] {$M(z = a + \\iu b)$};", "  \\fill (2,-1.5) circle (1pt) node[below right] {$\\conj z = a - \\iu b$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 点 $M(a,b)$ 的对应复数为 $z$：模 $\\abs z$ 是", "线段 $OM$ 的长度，共轭复数 $\\conj z$ 是 $z$ 关于", "实轴的对称点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[模的性质]\\label{prop:g12:complex:modulus}", "对 $z, w \\in \\C$：", "\\[", "\\abs{zw} = \\abs z\\,\\abs w, \\qquad", "\\abs{\\tfrac zw} = \\tfrac{\\abs z}{\\abs w}\\ (w \\neq 0), \\qquad", "\\abs{\\conj z} = \\abs z, \\qquad", "\\abs{z + w} \\leq \\abs{z} + \\abs{w} \\ \\text{(三角不等式)}.", "\\]", "此外，$\\abs{z_B - z_A}$ 是对应复数为", "$z_A$ 与 $z_B$ 的两点间的距离。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\abs{zw}^2 = zw\\,\\conj{zw} = z\\conj z\\, w \\conj w = \\abs z^2 \\abs w^2$", "即得第一式；第二式与第三式类似。对于三角", "不等式：", "\\[", "\\abs{z+w}^2 = (z+w)(\\conj z + \\conj w)", "= \\abs z^2 + \\abs w^2 + 2\\Rea(z \\conj w)", "\\leq \\abs z^2 + \\abs w^2 + 2\\abs{z\\conj w}", "= \\bigl(\\abs z + \\abs w\\bigr)^2,", "\\]", "利用 $\\Rea(u) \\leq \\abs u$。距离的结论即为将勾股", "公式用于 $z_B - z_A$ 的坐标。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}